sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant E as Editor
    participant H as History
    participant R as Render
    U->>E: press at a
    E->>E: start draw drag, preview at a
    E->>R: draw document and preview
    R-->>U: frame
    U->>E: move to b
    E->>E: rebuild preview from a, b
    E->>R: draw document and preview
    R-->>U: frame
    U->>E: release at b
    alt big enough
        E->>H: push current shapes
        E->>E: add on top, select it
    else one cell wide or tall
        E->>E: status message, discard
    end
    E->>R: draw document
    R-->>U: frame
